1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,808
Padhai poori, par gaon mein koi kaam nahi. Sheher jaaun kya?

2
00:00:04,108 --> 00:00:08,431
Imran, sheher kyun? Bakri paalan kar! Bakri ko gareeb ki gaay kehte hain.

3
00:00:08,731 --> 00:00:11,067
Par Ammi, bakriyan sambhalega kaun?

4
00:00:11,367 --> 00:00:17,551
Das bakri, ek bakra aur shed, 1 lakh 20 hazaar. Tu, main aur teri behen, sab sambhaal lenge.

5
00:00:17,851 --> 00:00:23,090
Achhi nasl, Sirohi ya Barbari lena. Saaf shed aur teeke, beemari paas nahi aayegi.

6
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:27,556
Imran bhai, tyohaar aa raha hai. Achhe tagde bakre chahiye!

7
00:00:27,856 --> 00:00:31,046
Dekhiye, ekdam tandurust. 15 hazaar ka ek!

8
00:00:31,346 --> 00:00:35,743
Har bakri saal mein do-teen bachche deti hai. Saal ke 2-3 lakh aaram se.

9
00:00:36,043 --> 00:00:40,226
Bakri ka doodh bhi bech, aur khaad bhi. Kuch bhi bekaar nahi jaata.

10
00:00:40,526 --> 00:00:43,874
Sheher nahi, gaon mein hi dhandha! Imran ki life set!
